        explanation: "Excision is correct because only a PORTION of the sigmoid colon (the body part) was removed. Resection would apply only if the ENTIRE sigmoid colon were removed. PCS treats each named segment of bowel as a separate body part — so partial removal of the sigmoid is Excision, while total removal of the sigmoid would be Resection.",
